---
// ServicesSection.astro
---

<section id="servicios" class="section services-section">
	<div class="section-container">
		<div class="section-header">
			<span class="section-badge font-cinzel">EXCLUSIVIDAD PRIVADA</span>
			<h2 class="section-title font-cinzel">Servicios de Grado <span class="gold-gradient-text">Institucional & Lujo</span></h2>
			<p class="section-subtitle">Arquitectura de alto nivel construida para multiplicar y proteger su patrimonio sin concesiones.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="cards-grid">
			<div class="luxury-card service-card">
				<div class="card-icon-box">
					<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="card-title font-cinzel">Gestión de Activos VIP</h3>
				<p class="card-desc">Portafolios diversificados de alta precisión en divisas premium, metales preciosos, commodities e instrumentos de alta rentabilidad.</p>
				<a href="/register" class="card-link">
					<span>Explorar Portafolios</span>
					<span>→</span>
				</a>
			</div>

			<div class="luxury-card service-card featured">
				<div class="featured-badge">MÁS SOLICITADO</div>
				<div class="card-icon-box">
					<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="card-title font-cinzel">Bóveda Cuántica de Rendimiento</h3>
				<p class="card-desc">Modelos predictivos en tiempo real con ejecución milimétrica que maximizan retornos y minimizan la volatilidad del mercado.</p>
				<a href="/register" class="card-link">
					<span>Ver Estrategias</span>
					<span>→</span>
				</a>
			</div>

			<div class="luxury-card service-card">
				<div class="card-icon-box">
					<svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
						<path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="card-title font-cinzel">Seguridad de Bóveda Suiza</h3>
				<p class="card-desc">Encriptación de última generación PBKDF2 y custodia fría multidireccional con auditorías continuas y privacidad estricta.</p>
				<a href="/register" class="card-link">
					<span>Conocer Protocolos</span>
					<span>→</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.section {
		padding: 85px 24px;
	}

	.section-container {
		max-width: 1240px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.section-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 55px;
	}

	.section-badge {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--gold-primary);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 12px;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		max-width: 620px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.cards-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 32px;
	}

	.service-card {
		padding: 38px 30px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		position: relative;
	}

	.service-card.featured {
		border-color: var(--gold-primary);
		box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
	}

	.featured-badge {
		position: absolute;
		top: 18px;
		right: 24px;
		background: var(--gold-gradient);
		color: #030712;
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		padding: 4px 10px;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}

	.card-icon-box {
		width: 56px;
		height: 56px;
		border-radius: 14px;
		background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid var(--gold-border);
		color: var(--gold-primary);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
	}

	.card-title {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 14px;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.card-desc {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
		flex-grow: 1;
	}

	.card-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		color: var(--gold-primary);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: transform 0.2s;
	}

	.card-link:hover {
		transform: translateX(4px);
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.cards-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
